<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -  Intel EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -  Intel EPS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised its earnings estimates for Intel Corp to $9.28 per share from $8.96 for 1997, and to $11.09 from $10.82 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- repeated a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 2-1/2 to 131-1/4.</p>
</text>
